---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Wyreup"
  description="Wyreup is an open-source library of file tools and utilities. Local tools process on your device; public network lookups and hosted PRO disclose what they send."
>
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="about-hero">
        <h1 class="about-title">Wyreup is for everyone with files.</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="about-body">

        <div class="about-section">
          <div class="about-prose">
            <p class="about-lede">Photos that need resizing. PDFs that need merging. Audio that needs trimming. Video that needs converting. The kind of small file tasks that come up in everyday life — and the kind that most tools want you to upload your private data to solve.</p>
            <p class="about-lede">Local file tools keep files on your computer. The free Domain Registration Age lookup sends the entered domain to Wyreup and its registration registry. Hosted PRO tools explain their remote processing before you run them. No analytics or tracking cookies.</p>
            <p>MIT-licensed. Open source. Verifiable. If you don't trust us, read the code.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="section-rule__line"></span>
          <span class="section-rule__pad"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-section-title">However you work</h2>
          <ul class="surfaces-list">
            <li><strong>If you're at your desk</strong>, drop a file in your <a href="/">browser</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>If you live in the terminal</strong>, install the <a href="/cli">CLI</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>If you work alongside an AI assistant</strong>, install the <a href="/skill">agent skill</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="section-rule__line"></span>
          <span class="section-rule__pad"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-section-title">Principles</h2>
          <ul class="principles-list">
            <li class="principle">
              <div class="principle__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="principle__line"></span>
                <span class="principle__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="principle__text">
                <strong>Choose where processing happens.</strong>
                <span>Local file tools use your CPU and GPU. Network lookups and hosted PRO tools explain what they send before you run them.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="principle">
              <div class="principle__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="principle__line"></span>
                <span class="principle__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="principle__text">
                <strong>No analytics. No tracking cookies. No third-party scripts.</strong>
                <span>Public lookups and hosted processing make the requests described by the tool. Our privacy policy explains temporary rate counters, reservation tokens, and platform logs.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="principle">
              <div class="principle__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="principle__line"></span>
                <span class="principle__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="principle__text">
                <strong>MIT-licensed. You can audit and self-host.</strong>
                <span>Every line is public. Fork it, inspect it, run it on your own infrastructure.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="principle">
              <div class="principle__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="principle__line"></span>
                <span class="principle__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="principle__text">
                <strong>Built to be boring.</strong>
                <span>Not chasing AI trends. Shipping tools that work, that stay working, and that do exactly what they say.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="section-rule__line"></span>
          <span class="section-rule__pad"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-section-title">Who built this</h2>
          <p class="about-prose-single">Built by people who care about privacy more than metrics.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="section-rule__line"></span>
          <span class="section-rule__pad"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-section-title">Contact</h2>
          <ul class="contact-list">
            <li class="contact-item">
              <div class="contact-item__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="contact-item__line"></span>
                <span class="contact-item__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-item__text">
                <span class="contact-item__label">General</span>
                <a href="mailto:hello@wyreup.com" class="contact-item__value">hello@wyreup.com</a>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="contact-item">
              <div class="contact-item__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="contact-item__line"></span>
                <span class="contact-item__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-item__text">
                <span class="contact-item__label">Security</span>
                <a href="mailto:security@wyreup.com" class="contact-item__value">security@wyreup.com</a>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="contact-item">
              <div class="contact-item__rule" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="contact-item__line"></span>
                <span class="contact-item__pad"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-item__text">
                <span class="contact-item__label">Source</span>
                <a href="https://github.com/tamler/wyreup" class="contact-item__value" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/tamler/wyreup</a>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="section-rule__line"></span>
          <span class="section-rule__pad"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section about-links">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/tamler/wyreup"
            class="about-github-link"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >View source on GitHub &rarr;</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-16);
  }

  .about-hero {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 640px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about-section-title {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-prose p,
  .about-prose-single {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-lede {
    font-size: var(--text-lg) !important;
    line-height: 1.6 !important;
  }

  .surfaces-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .surfaces-list li {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .surfaces-list li strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .surfaces-list li a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color var(--duration-instant) var(--ease-sharp);
  }

  .surfaces-list li a:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Solder-pad section rule */
  .section-rule {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .section-rule__line {
    display: block;
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .section-rule__pad {
    display: block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Principles list */
  .principles-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .principle {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .principle__rule {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .principle__line {
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .principle__pad {
    display: block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .principle__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .principle__text strong {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .principle__text span {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Contact list */
  .contact-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .contact-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .contact-item__rule {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .contact-item__line {
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .contact-item__pad {
    display: block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .contact-item__text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .contact-item__label {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    width: 64px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .contact-item__value {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--duration-instant) var(--ease-sharp);
  }

  .contact-item__value:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* GitHub link */
  .about-github-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--duration-instant) var(--ease-sharp);
  }

  .about-github-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
